{
    "title": "GYD003 | Digital watchface",
    "description": "TIZEN OS not available, available from Wear OS 4 or higher (API Level 30+).\r\n\r\n!! Be sure to read it. !!\r\n\r\n* This watchface is optimized for Samsung Galaxy Watch 4 or higher (Wear OS 4 or higher) and requires at least API level 30 or higher. \r\nCheck your smartwatch model and Wear OS version and install.\r\n\r\n* Please note that if a user who does not have a smartwatch purchases this app, they will not be able to install and use the watch face.\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------------\r\n[How to install watch face]\r\n\r\nThis app is available in two versions: a phone app and a watch face. We recommend installing using method 1.\r\n\r\nMethod 1) Install watch face through mobile phone app\r\n\r\n* If you have installed the mobile phone app (app name: GY watchface) on your phone, you can install the watch face on your smartwatch by following the app's instructions. \r\n\r\nMethod 2) Install the watch face directly through the Play Store \r\n\r\n* If your smartwatch is connected to your phone, you can install this watch face right away by pressing the triangle menu next to the Install or Purchase button in the Play Store and selecting the watch connected to your phone from the displayed device list. Please refer to the installation guide provided with photos.\r\n* Please note that the smartwatch must be connected to your mobile phone. Also, the Google account (email address) connected to the smartwatch on your phone must match the Play Store login account (email address).\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------------\r\n\r\n* If the developer updates the watch face, the screenshot and the watch face installed on the actual watch may differ.\r\n\r\n* GY.watchface SNS\r\n- Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/gywatchface\r\n- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/gy.watchface",
    "descriptionHTML": "TIZEN OS not available, available from Wear OS 4 or higher (API Level 30+).<br><br>!! Be sure to read it. !!<br><br>* This watchface is optimized for Samsung Galaxy Watch 4 or higher (Wear OS 4 or higher) and requires at least API level 30 or higher. <br>Check your smartwatch model and Wear OS version and install.<br><br>* Please note that if a user who does not have a smartwatch purchases this app, they will not be able to install and use the watch face.<br><br>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------------<br>[How to install watch face]<br><br>This app is available in two versions: a phone app and a watch face. We recommend installing using method 1.<br><br>Method 1) Install watch face through mobile phone app<br><br>* If you have installed the mobile phone app (app name: GY watchface) on your phone, you can install the watch face on your smartwatch by following the app&#39;s instructions. <br><br>Method 2) Install the watch face directly through the Play Store <br><br>* If your smartwatch is connected to your phone, you can install this watch face right away by pressing the triangle menu next to the Install or Purchase button in the Play Store and selecting the watch connected to your phone from the displayed device list. Please refer to the installation guide provided with photos.<br>* Please note that the smartwatch must be connected to your mobile phone. Also, the Google account (email address) connected to the smartwatch on your phone must match the Play Store login account (email address).<br><br>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------------<br><br>* If the developer updates the watch face, the screenshot and the watch face installed on the actual watch may differ.<br><br>* GY.watchface SNS<br>- Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/gywatchface<br>- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/gy.watchface",
    "summary": "This is the digital watch face of GY watchface. It features a small analog clock implemented digitally.",
